  <data key="d1">LOCATION</data>
  <data key="d2">A location in Cornwall, England. It is referenced in the text as part of the journey. St. Mawe's Castle is a historical site, and its mention in the text suggests its relevance to the narrative. The text highlights the exploration of such landmarks during the journey.</data>
