<node id="FLUSHING">
  <data key="d0">FLUSHING</data>
  <data key="d1">LOCATION</data>
  <data key="d2">A location in Cornwall, England. Flushing is mentioned in the text as a place that will be visited. It is a small village near Falmouth, and its inclusion in the journey indicates its significance in the narrative. The text describes the view from the Green Bank Hotel in Flushing, emphasizing its scenic value.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6196f7575ff952a3f5db2b2d296af03f</data>
