<node id="THE LIZARD">
  <data key="d0">THE LIZARD</data>
  <data key="d1">LOCATION</data>
  <data key="d2">A location in Cornwall, England. The Lizard is mentioned in the text as a place that will be explored. It is a headland known for its dramatic coastline and lighthouses. The text references the Lizard Lights, both by day and night, suggesting its importance in the journey.&lt;SEP&gt;The Lizard is another name for the location in Cornwall, specifically referring to the area where the narrative unfolds. It is noted for its weather conditions and the presence of a post office. The Lizard is a key location in the story, influencing the actions and interactions of the characters.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9baf49d70e5cdf906cbc1334a05b60e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6196f7575ff952a3f5db2b2d296af03f</data>
