  <data key="d1">LOCATION</data>
  <data key="d2">A cellar is a structure mentioned in the text, referenced as a fisherman's cellar near the Lizard. It is described as a subterranean dwelling with historical significance. The cellar is significant in the context of the narrative as it represents a mysterious and ancient feature of the landscape.</data>
