</node>
<node id="LIZARD TOWN">
  <data key="d0">LIZARD TOWN</data>
  <data key="d1">LOCATION</data>
  <data key="d2">A small village in Cornwall, England, known for its picturesque church and coastal setting. It is part of the parish of Landewednack and has a rich history tied to the Cornish language and culture.&lt;SEP&gt;Lizard Town is a coastal town in Cornwall, known for its serpentine rock formations and shops selling items made from this material. It is a destination mentioned in the narrative as the travelers approach their journey's end.&lt;SEP&gt;Lizard Town is a location mentioned in the text, where the narrator and others observe people walking home under the moonlight. It is described as a place with two hotels that co-exist close together. The town is part of the setting and plays a role in the social interactions described in the narrative.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c3755e64526057a08de86199d3391703&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a5dd17ac6c7028198a21adf7ff042f8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1d2b2559cbc455b5cb2409b4efdaf8e</data>
