  <data key="d0">CORNISH HEATH</data>
  <data key="d1">PLANT</data>
  <data key="d2">The Cornish heath, scientifically known as _erica vagans_, is a plant species found exclusively in certain areas of Cornwall and a district of Portugal. It is notable for its beauty and unique botanical characteristics, such as the position of its anthers.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c3755e64526057a08de86199d3391703</data>
