<node id="HARVEST MOON">
  <data key="d0">HARVEST MOON</data>
  <data key="d1">CELESTIAL_BODY</data>
  <data key="d2">The harvest moon is a celestial body mentioned in the text, described as radiating a silent peace and symbolizing a transformation from 'the spirit of heaviness' to 'a garment of praise.' It is a significant element in the narrative, influencing the mood and atmosphere of the journey. The moon is associated with the themes of beauty, tranquility, and spiritual reflection.&lt;SEP&gt;The harvest moon is a celestial body mentioned in the text, likely referring to a full moon that occurs around the time of the harvest season. It is described as being bright and competing with the Lizard Lights. Its significance lies in its beauty and the atmosphere it creates during the night. It contributes to the setting of the journey and enhances the mood of the narrative.</data>
