<node id="CLIFFS">
  <data key="d0">CLIFFS</data>
  <data key="d1">NATURAL_FEATURE</data>
  <data key="d2">A natural element that is part of the landscape, contributing to the setting of the scene. The cliffs are described as a place where the narrator sits to watch the sunset, emphasizing their role in the narrative.&lt;SEP&gt;A natural feature of the Cornish coast, characterized by cliffs and rocky outcrops. These areas provide access to secluded coves and sea caves, offering unique natural experiences.</data>
