  <data key="d0">SEA</data>
  <data key="d1">NATURAL_FEATURE</data>
  <data key="d2">A body of water that is described as blue and clear, forming part of the Cornish coastline. It is associated with the natural beauty and recreational activities of the region.&lt;SEP&gt;A body of water where the sun sets. The sea is described as being bathed in the rosy sunset, emphasizing its role in the natural scenery and the emotional experience of the narrator.</data>
