</node>
<node id="POLTESCO">
  <data key="d0">POLTESCO</data>
  <data key="d1">LOCATION</data>
  <data key="d2">A location in Cornwall known for its serpentine works, which are a significant part of the local industry. The text describes the machinery, the workmen, and the craftsmanship involved in creating items from serpentine. It is an important economic and cultural hub in the region.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-436157d1f1611fd4639ef4c3e3e77cf8</data>
  <data key="d4">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 13}]</data>
</node>
