  <data key="d0">HONEYSUCKLE</data>
  <data key="d1">PLANT</data>
  <data key="d2">A flowering plant commonly found in coastal areas. The text mentions honeysuckle as one of the plants collected by the group during their visit. It is associated with the natural beauty of the region and contributes to the aesthetic appeal of the landscape.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-436157d1f1611fd4639ef4c3e3e77cf8</data>
  <data key="d4">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 3}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 18}]</data>
