  <data key="d0">SAND-PLANTS</data>
  <data key="d1">PLANT</data>
  <data key="d2">A type of plant that grows near the coast and is often found in rocky areas. The text refers to sand-plants as part of the flora collected by the group. These plants are adapted to the harsh conditions of the coastal environment.</data>
