  <data key="d1">RELIGION</data>
  <data key="d2">A religious group or denomination, specifically mentioned as a Methodist. The inhabitant's affiliation with this group highlights his religious identity and values. It also provides context for his behavior and social interactions.&lt;SEP&gt;Methodist, Quaker, and Church of England are religious groups mentioned in the text. These denominations reflect the religious diversity of Cornwall, emphasizing the region's strong religious traditions and the presence of nonconformist sects alongside the established church.</data>
