<node id="CHURCH OF ENGLAND">
  <data key="d0">CHURCH OF ENGLAND</data>
  <data key="d1">RELIGION</data>
  <data key="d2">Methodist, Quaker, and Church of England are religious groups mentioned in the text. These denominations reflect the religious diversity of Cornwall, emphasizing the region's strong religious traditions and the presence of nonconformist sects alongside the established church.</data>
