<node id="CHICKENS">
  <data key="d3">chunk-eaa5de23ba6f27901db4cc60fd6df0ae</data>
  <data key="d2">The 'old hen' has a direct relationship with her 'chickens,' as she is the leader and guide of the group. She sets the rules for the journey and expects them to follow her instructions. This relationship is based on authority and responsibility, with the 'old hen' ensuring the safety and enjoyment of the group.</data>
