  <data key="d2">The relationship between the Lizard Lights and the fog-horn. Both the Lizard Lights and the fog-horn are powered by the same steam-engine, and they both serve the purpose of guiding ships through dangerous conditions. This relationship highlights the interconnected systems used for maritime safety.</data>
