<edge source="ST. MICHAEL'S MOUNT" target="ST. AUBYNS">
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
  <data key="d6">The St. Aubyns are residents of St. Michael's Mount, which has been their home for generations. This relationship highlights their deep historical and familial connection to the location. The significance of this relationship is that it reflects the long-standing tradition of the family living in a challenging and isolated environment. The relationship evolved over time as the family adapted to the conditions of the mount, and notable events like the daughter's fall from the battlements illustrate the risks involved.</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-744360fec46b02217eb1d4d9f455cb8a</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="ST. MICHAEL'S MOUNT" target="NURSERY RHYME">
  <data key="d5">1.2999999999999998</data>
  <data key="d6">The narrator visited St. Michael's Mount after learning about it through the nursery rhyme. This relationship shows the influence of cultural references on travel decisions. The significance of this relationship is that it connects the literary world with real-world exploration. The relationship evolved as the narrator experienced the location firsthand, leading to a deeper appreciation of its beauty and challenges. The visit was influenced by the nursery rhyme, which shaped the narrator's expectations and experience.&lt;SEP&gt;The narrator's visit to St. Michael's Mount was influenced by the nursery rhyme, which created an expectation of the location. This second-order relationship shows how cultural references can shape perceptions and experiences. The significance of this relationship is that it demonstrates the interplay between literature and real-world exploration. The relationship evolved as the narrator's actual experience of the location differed from the expectations set by the rhyme. The nursery rhyme served as a catalyst for the journey, influencing the narrator's interest in the place.</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-744360fec46b02217eb1d4d9f455cb8a</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="FALMOUTH" target="JOURNEY">
  <data key="d5">0.7</data>
