<edge source="KYNANCE COVE" target="CHARACTERS">
  <data key="d5">0.9</data>
  <data key="d6">The characters in the narrative have a direct relationship with the locations of Kynance Cove, Asparagus Island, and the Bellows. These locations serve as the settings for their activities and interactions, and they influence their experiences and perceptions. The relationship between the characters and the locations is characterized by exploration, adventure, and appreciation of natural beauty.</data>
