<edge source="TINTAGEL" target="ARTHURIAN LEGENDS">
  <data key="d5">0.8</data>
  <data key="d6">Tintagel is directly connected to the Arthurian legends, serving as a symbolic and historical site associated with King Arthur. The ruins of Tintagel represent the remnants of a bygone era and are integral to the narrative's exploration of history, mythology, and the enduring ideals of chivalry.</data>
