<edge source="JACK THE GIANTKILLER" target="KING ARTHUR">
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
  <data key="d6">Jack the Giantkiller and King Arthur share a second-order relationship through their influence on the cultural identity of Cornwall. Both are legendary figures associated with the region, and their stories reflect similar values of justice, courage, and perseverance. Their legacies continue to shape the perception of Cornish culture and history.</data>
