  <data key="d8">2</data>
</edge>
<edge source="KING ARTHUR" target="JOHN CURGENVEN">
  <data key="d5">0.8</data>
  <data key="d6">John Curgenven is associated with the legend of King Arthur, as the text speculates whether the type of man depicted by Tennyson still exists in modern Cornwall. This relationship connects the real-life character to the mythical figure, highlighting the cultural and historical significance of both.</data>
