<edge source="KING ARTHUR" target="CHOUGH">
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
  <data key="d6">The relationship between King Arthur and the chough is symbolic, as the chough is believed to be the vessel through which King Arthur's soul revisits the familiar scene. This connection is rooted in local folklore and adds a mystical dimension to the chough's presence in the region. The belief in this relationship reinforces the cultural and historical significance of both entities.</data>
