<edge source="KING ARTHUR" target="CORNWALL">
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
  <data key="d6">The relationship between King Arthur and the landscape of Cornwall is indirect but significant. The text suggests that the wild and dramatic environment of Cornwall, including its coastlines and caves, contributed to the creation of the Arthurian legend. This relationship reflects how geography and culture interact to shape historical narratives and collective imagination.</data>
