  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
  <data key="d6">The relationship between the Coast-Guard and the people of Cornwall. The Coast-Guard is described as being 'the pick of the service' and is tasked with saving lives, especially during shipwrecks. Their work is vital to the safety of the coastal community.</data>
