<edge source="CORNWALL" target="NARRATOR">
  <data key="d5">0.7</data>
  <data key="d6">The relationship between the narrator and the natural landscape of Cornwall is indirect but influential. The narrator's journey through the region exposes them to its unique geography, including the Lizard and Mullion Cove. These locations shape the narrator's experience and contribute to their appreciation of the area. The natural environment plays a key role in the narrative, influencing the narrator's perceptions and interactions.</data>
