  <data key="d8">2</data>
</edge>
<edge source="CORNWALL" target="MINING BUSINESS">
  <data key="d5">0.6</data>
  <data key="d6">The relationship between the mining industry in Cornwall and the local population is indirect. The decline of the mining business led to economic hardship, forcing people to emigrate or starve, forming a second-order relationship.</data>
