<edge source="CORNWALL" target="ARTHUR">
  <data key="d5">0.7</data>
  <data key="d6">The legend of Arthur is deeply intertwined with the natural and cultural landscape of Cornwall. The region's folklore, including stories of ghosts and supernatural beings, is part of the broader Arthurian mythos. This relationship reflects the cultural and historical significance of the region in shaping the Arthurian legends.</data>
