<edge source="CORNWALL" target="DELABOLE QUARRIES">
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
  <data key="d6">The Delabole quarries represent a contrast to the romantic and mythical elements of the Arthurian legends. While the quarries are described as an un-sentimental place, they reflect the historical and industrial significance of the region. This relationship highlights the duality of the narrative, blending myth with reality.</data>
