<edge source="CORNWALL" target="TREGEAGLE">
  <data key="d5">0.6</data>
  <data key="d6">Tregeagle's legend is connected to the supernatural elements of the narrative, particularly the ghostly stories of Cornwall. His association with the demon and the sinking of his home to the bottom of the mere reinforces the eerie and mystical atmosphere of the region. This relationship underscores the cultural and mythological significance of Tregeagle in Cornish folklore.</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-296767ee0019736ba3b3907d25d663f6</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
</edge>
