<edge source="OLD GENTLEMAN" target="TRAVELERS">
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
  <data key="d6">The old gentleman provides advice to the travelers about the Cornish people and suggests visiting Gerrans. This relationship is direct, as the old gentleman actively engages with the travelers and shares his insights. The impact of this relationship is that it influences the travelers' decision-making process regarding their destination and expectations of local hospitality.</data>
