<edge source="OLD GENTLEMAN" target="TIDE">
  <data key="d5">0.6</data>
  <data key="d6">The relationship between the narrator and the tide indirectly affects the narrator's interactions with the old gentleman and the young people. The urgency created by the tide influences the decisions and actions of all involved.</data>
