<edge source="WE" target="FRIEND">
  <data key="d5">1.7000000000000002</data>
  <data key="d6">The relationship between the friend and the travelers is further reinforced by the friend's ability to provide practical solutions, such as securing lodgings and arranging transportation. This relationship is significant as it demonstrates the friend's proactive and supportive nature, which greatly influences the travelers' ability to navigate their journey smoothly. The friend's actions create a foundation of trust and dependability that benefits the travelers throughout their trip.&lt;SEP&gt;The relationship between the travelers ('we') and their friend is characterized by trust and support. The friend provides practical assistance, such as helping them find lodgings and sending telegrams. This relationship is significant because it facilitates the travelers' journey and contributes to their comfort and safety. The friend's actions demonstrate a strong sense of care and responsibility towards the travelers.</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-85b0c1bb6db9932af72e242802e01101</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="WE" target="CHARLES">
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
  <data key="d6">The relationship between the travelers and Charles, the driver, is built on trust and reliability. Charles is described as a reliable and kind individual who ensures the safe and comfortable travel of the travelers. This relationship is significant because it directly impacts the success of the journey, as Charles's competence and dependability are essential for the travelers' experience. The travelers' confidence in Charles enhances their overall enjoyment of the trip.</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-85b0c1bb6db9932af72e242802e01101</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="WE" target="LIZARD">
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
  <data key="d6">The relationship between the travelers and the Lizard is indirect, as it is influenced by the friend's recommendation and the travelers' decision to go there. This relationship is significant because it represents the travelers' choice to move beyond their initial accommodation at Green Bank and explore a new destination. The Lizard becomes a focal point of their journey, shaping their experiences and expectations.</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-85b0c1bb6db9932af72e242802e01101</data>
  <data key="d8">2</data>
</edge>
<edge source="WE" target="GREEN BANK">
  <data key="d5">0.7</data>
  <data key="d6">The relationship between the travelers and the Green Bank is indirect, as it is influenced by their decision to stay there before moving on to the Lizard. This relationship is significant because it sets the stage for their journey, providing a base from which they can explore other locations. The Green Bank's comfort and homely peace contribute to the travelers' initial experiences and influence their subsequent decisions.</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-85b0c1bb6db9932af72e242802e01101</data>
  <data key="d8">2</data>
</edge>
<edge source="WE" target="ORNAMENTAL">
  <data key="d5">0.7</data>
  <data key="d6">The relationship between the group of travelers and the ornamental items in the room. The travelers felt that the ornamental items were unattractive and suggested removing them in favor of more practical items like jars for wild flowers.</data>
