</edge>
<edge source="WE" target="JARS">
  <data key="d5">0.8</data>
  <data key="d6">The relationship between the travelers and the jars, salt-jars, and jam-pots they requested. These items were used to display the wild flowers, transforming the room into a more appealing space.</data>
