  <data key="d8">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="WE" target="CORNISH COAST">
  <data key="d5">1.5</data>
  <data key="d6">The relationship between the natural beauty of the Cornish coast and the emotional impact on the travelers. The vivid descriptions of the landscape and weather evoke a deep appreciation and lasting memory of the region.&lt;SEP&gt;The relationship between the natural elements of the Cornish coast and the travelers' experience. The natural beauty of the region, including the sea, cliffs, and flowers, greatly influenced the travelers' perception and enjoyment of their journey.</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-12e1d0ddbd52f7c9b5db9fe78dbfee83</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
</edge>
