  <data key="d5">0.7</data>
  <data key="d6">The relationship between the Atlantic waves and the safety of the travelers. The waves are described as powerful and potentially dangerous, requiring caution during bathing and other activities along the coast.</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-12e1d0ddbd52f7c9b5db9fe78dbfee83</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="WE" target="CLIFFS">
  <data key="d5">0.6</data>
  <data key="d6">The relationship between the natural features of the Cornish coast and the sense of adventure and risk. The cliffs, coves, and sea caves offer opportunities for exploration but also pose risks, creating a balance between beauty and danger.</data>
