  <data key="d5">0.8</data>
  <data key="d6">The observers (we) are directly affected by the luminous circle around the sun. This natural phenomenon captures their attention and evokes a sense of mystery and wonder. The relationship highlights the emotional and intellectual impact of the event on the observers.</data>
