  <data key="d5">0.7</data>
  <data key="d6">The relationship between the sea-caves and the other caves (like Dolor Ugo and the Lizard caves) is one of comparison and contrast. The sea-caves are described as more impressive and terrifying, emphasizing their unique qualities. This relationship highlights the relative significance and distinctiveness of the sea-caves within the broader context of Cornish landmarks.</data>
  <data key="d7">chunk-aa4d7fdb9f89afdae781a33e7abe6b36</data>
  <data key="d8">2</data>
